00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.399
Congratulations. You've completed the course

00:00:02.399 --> 00:00:04.799
and now have a solid foundation for creating,

00:00:04.799 --> 00:00:08.800
observing, evaluating, and deploying intelligent agent workflows

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.480
using NAT. You turn Python functions into reusable tools,

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:17.179
build agents that reason about which tools to use, analyzed real-world data,

00:00:17.179 --> 00:00:20.280
and made agent behavior visible with tracing and evaluations.

00:00:20.579 --> 00:00:22.379
You orchestrated multiple agents,

00:00:22.579 --> 00:00:24.280
evaluated agentic performance,

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:26.879
and deployed workflows as production-ready applications

00:00:26.879 --> 00:00:28.879
with APIs and a polished interface.

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:32.880
With these skills, you can systematically debug, measure, and improve agents,

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:36.579
scale workflows, and combine tools and agents to solve new problems.

00:00:36.979 --> 00:00:38.880
Keep experimenting and exploring.

00:00:38.979 --> 00:00:40.679
I'm excited to see what you build.
